harness/db/schema.sql:489:--   1. OpenAI's OWN monthly budget cap ($100), set in their dashboard. That is the
harness/db/schema.sql:490:--      REAL ceiling — it physically stops them serving requests, and no bug in this
harness/db/schema.sql:495:--      budget we set ourselves — so we stop gracefully, say why, and never hit
