harness/mouth.py:86:  1. DISPATCH        "kick off the rate limiter", "put Riggs on it"
harness/mouth.py:88:  3. THE OVERNIGHT   "what ran last night", "what shipped"
harness/mouth.py:89:  4. ACKNOWLEDGE     "yes", "no", "stop", "cancel", "go ahead", "never mind"
harness/mouth.py:96:he's worried about something. If he pushes back on you. If he asks about the design,
